# Code Owners
#
# This file defines individuals or teams responsible for code in this repository.
# Code owners are automatically requested for review when someone opens a pull
# request that modifies code they own.
#
# Order is important; the last matching pattern takes precedence.
#
# Documentation: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default owners for everything in the repo
# These owners will be requested for review unless a later match takes precedence.
* @Sage-is/maintainers

# Documentation
*.md @Sage-is/documentation
/docs/ @Sage-is/documentation

# GitHub configuration files
/.github/ @Sage-is/maintainers

# Workflow files
/.github/workflows/ @Sage-is/maintainers @Sage-is/devops

# Security and policy files
/SECURITY.md @Sage-is/security
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md @Sage-is/maintainers
/CONTRIBUTING.md @Sage-is/maintainers

# Configuration files
*.yml @Sage-is/devops
*.yaml @Sage-is/devops
*.json @Sage-is/devops

# CI/CD
/.github/workflows/ @Sage-is/devops
/.github/dependabot.yml @Sage-is/devops

# Legal and licensing
/LICENSE @Sage-is/legal
